{"name":"Flashlight","hex":"#f9eed6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"flashlight","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A battery-powered hand-held light source.","A flashgun (device used to create flashes of light for photography)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To illuminate with a flashlight."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/flashlight"}],"entries":[{"title":"Flashlight","blocks":[{"text":"A flashlight or electric torch, usually shortened to torch, is a portable hand-held electric lamp. Formerly, the light source typically was a miniature incandescent light bulb, but these have been displaced by light-emitting diodes (LEDs) since the early 2000s. A typical flashlight consists of the light source mounted in a reflector, a transparent cover to protect the light source and reflector, a battery, and a switch, all enclosed in a case."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/LED_Flashlights.jpg/330px-LED_Flashlights.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flashlight"},{"title":"Flashlight (Jessie J song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Flashlight\" is a song recorded by British singer Jessie J for the soundtrack to the film Pitch Perfect 2 (2015). The song was written by Sia, Christian Guzman, Jason Moore, and Sam Smith. The song was originally obtained when one pre-ordered the Pitch Perfect 2 soundtrack in the United States, beginning on 23 April 2015; it later became available for download on its own. \"Flashlight\" was released in the United Kingdom on 11 May 2015 both on the soundtrack and as a stand-alone single."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/11/Jessie_J_-_Flashlight_%28Official_Single_Cover%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flashlight_(Jessie_J_song)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/co